  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(GALVmed) The development and delivery of new effective and cheap animal vaccines and medicines to poor livestock keepers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new phase of funding to GALVmed (VITAL-2) will deliver:
1.	A portfolio of vaccines, medicines and diagnostic from product development through to final registration, identified in partnership with the veterinary industry as being high priority.
2.	new work to build sustainable commercial animal health networks drawing on the lessons from VITAL-1 and 
3.	work to build an enabling public policy environment for the development of commercial animal health markets.</narrative>
  </description>
